sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant CONSUMER as Consumer / Curator (External)
  participant LOOKUP as Resolved Entity Lookup Service (App Service)
  participant ORCH as ERS Orchestrator (App Component)
  participant REG as Canonical Entity Registry (App Component)

  CONSUMER->>LOOKUP: GetCanonicalIdentifier(originId, requestId)
  LOOKUP->>ORCH: forward lookup request (service invocation)

  ORCH->>REG: query canonicalId & cluster membership (by originId+requestId or canonical_id)
  REG-->>ORCH: CanonicalIdentifier + ClusterMembers + Metadata

  ORCH-->>LOOKUP: CanonicalIdentifier + ClusterMembers
  LOOKUP-->>CONSUMER: 200 CanonicalIdentifier + ClusterMembers + Metadata

  alt Not found
    REG-->>ORCH: null (no prior resolution)
    ORCH-->>LOOKUP: not found
    LOOKUP-->>CONSUMER: 404 EntityNotFound or 204 NoContent
  end
